hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"149","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Mujhe apne halal se haram se bekhabar kar de, aur apne fazl se apne siwa se ghani kar de. [Qarz par padhe]"
"150","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Main fikr aur gham se, aajizi aur susti se, buzdili aur bukhl se, qarz ke bojh se aur logon ke ghalbe se teri panah chahta hun. [Qarz aur pareshani par]"
